.TH "MODULE:UPDATE" 1 "October 2026" "SPP Framework" "SPP Commands Manual"
.SH NAME
module:update \- Execute database sync, migrations, and update hooks for a module or all modules
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B php spp.php module:update
[\fImodulename\fR] [\fB--from=\fIversion\fR] [\fB--to=\fIversion\fR] [\fB--all\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
\fBmodule:update\fR performs database schema synchronizations from \fBdb.yml\fR, triggers
pre-upgrade, update, and post-upgrade hooks on the module's \fBServiceProvider\fR, and updates
version tracking records in the \fBspp_modules\fR table.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fImodulename\fR
Internal name of the module to update.
.TP
\fB--all\fR
Iterate through and upgrade all currently active modules.
.TP
\fB--from=\fIversion\fR
Specify the baseline version for manual lifecycle invocation.
.TP
\fB--to=\fIversion\fR
Specify the target version for manual lifecycle invocation.
.SH UNDER THE HOOD
Instantiates the declared \fBServiceProvider\fR, reads declarative table definitions from \fBdb.yml\fR,
performs incremental DDL migrations via the database adapter, and updates metadata in the \fBspp_modules\fR table.
